  "body_html": "<h1>game_eq_toStrategicGame</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma game_eq_toStrategicGame (v : I → U) : game v = mechanism.toStrategicGame (fun (w : I) (pay : I → U) (vals : I → U) (i : I) =&gt; if i = w then vals i - pay i else 0) v</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>toStrategicGame</li>\n<li>toStrategicGame</li>\n<li>toStrategicGame</li>\n</ul>",
